      "timestamp_epoch_ms": 1598931305000,
      "timestamp_raw": "Aug 31, 2020 22:35:05 GMT -5",
      "body_html": "This plant was \"lost\" for several years in the collection (ie. it was hidden by other leucophyllas) and I didn't find it until last winter.  When that happened, two fists went up in the air, followed by a loud, screaming \"YAAAAAAAASSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS!!!!\"  Intense eye rolling by my wife occurred shortly thereafter.<br/><br/>Pics taken 8/28/20:<br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50292741351_598e3323f1_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50292062328_8887429363_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50292060613_84b9ed5e60_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/><img src=\"https://live.staticflickr.com/65535/50292885152_4e835fb74a_c.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;\"/><br/><br/>",
      "body_text": "This plant was \"lost\" for several years in the collection (ie. it was hidden by other leucophyllas) and I didn't find it until last winter.  When that happened, two fists went up in the air, followed by a loud, screaming \"YAAAAAAAASSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSSS!!!!\"  Intense eye rolling by my wife occurred shortly thereafter.\nPics taken 8/28/20:",
